 IDS_DRIVES_EJECTING "Asking Windows for safe removal…"
 IDS_DRIVES_EJECTED "Windows accepted safe removal. Refresh to check current devices before unplugging anything else."
 IDS_DRIVES_SCOPE "Explicit requests only. Windows can veto a busy device. A started removal can complete even if Dako closes; Dako cannot reconnect a removed device. Preview/fixtures cannot eject."
 IDS_DRIVES_COMMAND "Review or eject removable drives"
 IDS_DRIVE_EJECT "Safely eject device"
 IDS_DRIVE_WARNING "Ask Windows to safely remove this device and its mounted volumes? Close its files first. Windows can refuse if it is busy or permissions are insufficient. A completed removal cannot be undone by Dako."
