 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_AC "Require AC power"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_EXTERNAL "Require an active external display"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_DISPLAY "Keep the display on when rules match"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_APPS "Selected app executable names"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_START "Start keep-awake rule monitoring"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_STARTING "Starting rule monitoring…"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_WAITING "Monitoring rules; waiting for every chosen condition to match. No keep-awake request is active."
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_ACTIVE "Rules match. Keeping the PC awake."
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_DISPLAY_ACTIVE "Rules match. Keeping the PC and display awake."
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_ON "On"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_OFF "Off"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_ANY "No app condition"
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_APPS_HELP "Enter up to eight executable file names separated by semicolons, for example editor.exe; player.exe. Blank removes the app condition. No paths or wildcards. Running apps in your session are checked once; window-create/show events discover later desktop app starts. Windowless relaunches may not be discovered until a resume or monitoring restart."
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_SCOPE "Choose at least one condition. Any selected running app satisfies the app condition; AC and external display must also match if chosen. Unknown state, lock or sleep releases the request. Start explicitly each session; rules do not auto-start after launch. Stop before editing. Native desktop apps only; protected apps and windowless starts may be unavailable."
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_INVALID "Invalid saved/app rule data. Enter executable names again before starting rules."
 IDS_AWAKE_RULE_SAVED "Rule settings saved. Start monitoring when ready."
 IDS_PERMISSION_PROCESS "Read selected executable names in this Windows session and wait for their process exit while rule monitoring is started. No command lines, window titles or file contents are read."
